<title>FRANCE: Gascogne sees profit up 10 pct in 1997.</title>
<headline>Gascogne sees profit up 10 pct in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper company Gascogne reiterated on Thursday that profit rose 10 percent last year, excluding exceptionals, and predicted similar growth for 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Excluding exceptionals, net profit for 1996 should be, as we previously said, up 10 percent,&quot; chairman Philippe Blanc told a news conference. He said there should be a similar growth rate in 1997.</p>
<p>Gascogne reported profit of 85.4 million francs in 1995 on sales of 3.03 billion.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
